    "detailed_description": "<strong>Game Mode</strong><br><br>Simulated business RPG<br><br>Running a tavern, earning money, upgrading a tavern, unlocking recipes,<br><br>Invite companions to take an adventure! Experience turn based battles, enhance relationships with your favorite characters, and date together!<br><br><br><strong>Game Introduction</strong><br><br>In order to pay off the debt owed by his father, Gu Mi, a young man who aspires to become a top chef, became the owner of the Lin Jian Tavern!<br><br>Gu Mi knew in his heart that running a tavern in such a remote place would definitely not be an easy task! But in order to pay off the debt, he can only persevere.<br><br>In the process of running a tavern, Gu Mi met many young people with vastly different personalities,<br><br>And in the process of interacting with teenagers, they understand each other and have gone through many experiences together,<br><br>And perhaps they have developed a feeling of surpassing each other's friends<br><br>In the end, will he be able to pay off all his debts, and with whom will he embark on a surprising love story?<br><br>Character<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650800/extras/35d55cde7e69aae3719899b1c98b5851.avif?t=1699010609\" data-has-big width=800 height=1130 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650800/extras/12d037ff90a69d9a0e22b920c122c7f1.avif?t=1699010609\" data-has-big width=800 height=1130 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650800/extras/741601f23b20e2fe10fa6f8263db6273.avif?t=1699010609\" data-has-big width=800 height=1130 /></span>",
